  "details": "One of my friends is very interested in the chatbox in general, and we tried testing the chatbox language filter, but it seems that it doesn't block any profanity at all.\n\nSpecific setup is with both a friended and unfriended user, all profanity words were visible with the language filter turned on.\n\nI presume this is a bug, but it may be a misunderstanding of how it's supposed to work, or perhaps it's too \"basic\" at the moment.",
